# The image builds from the repository root (server/Dockerfile) so the web UI
# can be compiled and embedded. Allowlist only what the build needs; .local/
# holds Compose media and must never enter the build context.
*
!server/
!web/
server/**/*_test.go
server/testdata
server/scripts
server/deploy
server/README.md
server/config.yaml
server/data
server/**/*.db
server/bin
server/internal/webui/dist/app
web/node_modules
